# k.colours/shards/colours-css: the 141 colour names of CSS with their RGB value, and the basic colour (family) each is a kind of where its name says it or it is plain.
# sources: css-colors 2.1.1 (the CSS named colours as listed by the package color-name 2.1.1, MIT: name and RGB)
# sources: hand-core 1 (the basic colour of a name that does not end in one, named=model; the word facts)
# license: MIT
# script: tools/values-core.mjs

